303	     * A user whose role may reassign moves a DRAFT, OPEN or PENDING claim to another person on the sheet. It keeps its number and date,
304	     * loses any figure a statement bound it to (live again until its new person's next statement), and is listed as
305	     * its new person's newest claim. Refused for a SETTLED or VOID claim, its own person, a closed period, a new person
306	     * retired before its date, or a user whose role may not reassign.
307	     */
308	    @Transactional
309	    public Claim reassign(String sheetId, String user, Long id, Long toPersonId) {
310	        Claim claim = claims.findForUpdate(id, sheetId)
311	                .orElseThrow(() -> new ClaimNotFoundException(sheetId, id));
312	        if (!roles.may(sheetId, user, "reassign")) {
313	            throw new ClaimReassignForbiddenException(id, user);
314	        }
315	        if (claim.getStatus() != ClaimStatus.DRAFT && !claim.getStatus().isOpen()) {
316	            throw new ClaimReassignException(id, "it is " + claim.getStatus());
